graph TD
    A[Oxidative Stress] --> B{ROS Type?}
    B -->|Superoxide| C[SOD Activation]
    B -->|Hydrogen Peroxide| D[Catalase Activation]
    B -->|Hydroxyl Radical| E[Antioxidant Response]
    
    C --> F[Superoxide Dismutation]
    F --> G[H2O2 Production]
    G --> H[Catalase Activity]
    H --> I[Water Formation]
    
    D --> J[H2O2 Decomposition]
    J --> I
    
    E --> K[Antioxidant Synthesis]
    K --> L[ROS Scavenging]
    L --> M[Oxidative Stress Response]
    
    I --> N[Oxidative Stress Response Complete]
    M --> N
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> O[DNA Damage]
    O --> P[DNA Repair Activation]
    P --> Q[DNA Repair Response]
    Q --> N
    
    %% Regulation
    N --> R[Stress Status]
    R --> S{Oxidative Stress Resolved?}
    S -->|Yes| T[Response Termination]
    S -->|No| U[Response Continuation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    V[SOD] --> C
    W[Catalase] --> D
    X[Antioxidants] --> E
    Y[DNA Repair Enzymes] --> P
    Z[ROS Scavengers] --> L
    AA[Stress Response Factors] --> N
    
